      "description": "Featured in Apple's \"Great on watchOS 6\" and \"Our Favourite Apple Watch Apps\" collections!\n#2 Casual Game in the US!\n\nKepler Attack is an arcade game for your iPhone and Apple Watch. Fly through space and destroy waves of alien space invaders from Kepler-452b.\n\n“I’m just amazed that this is on my Watch.” - Tom, host of The Apple WatchCast Podcast - http://www.applewatchcast.com\n\n“I think this is actually my personal favorite new game now on the Apple Watch because of its really fast pacing which is perfect for these types of games.” - HotshotTek, 10 Awesome Apple Watch Games Apps of 2019\n\n• Inspired by Gyruss, Galaga, Galaxian and Space Invaders!\n• Beautiful retro arcade graphics!\n• Fast paced alien attack waves with a variety of enemy space invaders!\n• Power-ups include Shield, Triple Shot, Rapid Fire and Smart Bomb!\n• Intuitive and simple controls using the Crown on the Watch!\n• Swipe to move on the iPhone!\n• Short burst gameplay is perfect for the Watch and iPhone!\n• Retro sound effects on the iPhone!\n• Play anywhere, anytime!\n• Includes Valentine's Day and Santa Christmas Holiday theme!\n• Runs at 60fps on the Watch!\n\nRelive the glory days of the arcade on your Apple Watch and iPhone.\n\nThanks for playing\nJohnno & Pete",
