      "releaseNotes": "- Kepler Attack now runs on M1 Macs!\n- Fixed UI issues on iPads and M1 Macs!\n- It's Santa time again! Help Santa destroy the rogue gift shaped Keplerian attack ships!\n\nPreviously  \n- 10 brand new enemy ships!\n- Sound effects on Watch version!\n- Minor UI tweaks\n\nThanks for playing,\nJohnno and Pete",
